{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】訪問歐洲巴爾幹半島的外長王毅與黑山總理斯帕伊奇會面。</p><p>王毅說中國和黑山有很多共同之處，包括取得反法西斯戰爭勝利，也警惕軍國主義的復活。</p><p>斯帕伊奇讚賞中國在中東戰事以負責任態度，抑制全球油價上漲，幫助黑山等中小國家渡過能源危機。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:58:52.538342+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:21:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:30.957154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:57:36.502427+00:00","content_hash":"58983fe343ea24fb808c23c2fce6eb59c807a809168d453f6c70146a1dc76a8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}